## Product decisions resolving reviewer notes (binding for T3 build)
1. CHANNELS = 7 everywhere: Website, Google Business, Facebook, Instagram, YouTube, LinkedIn, X.
   Sample report gains X + Website rows (plausible scores + one-line insights, same voice).
   Fix Manual 3 "five channel scores" → "seven channel scores".
2. Landing must PREVIEW real sample data (Story 2): one community post card + a mini report
   teaser with 3 of the 7 channel scores, both labeled sample.
3. Every community post card carries its own "Sample" tag (not just a feed-level label).
4. First entry after join = "Welcome, {name}"; returning sign-in = "Welcome back, {name}".
5. Community post 3: "Encoded a lighting guide" → "Made a lighting guide".
6. Founder story at 88 words: accepted as-is.
7. Sign-out semantics (stories.md Story 11 conflict): member RECORD persists in
   localStorage; sign-out clears only the session flag and returns to landing with a
   "Sign in" affordance; sign-in matches the stored email, no password. While signed out
   no member content is reachable.

